"www.aldahotels.es/firma/email/llegada/check-in.png\" alt=\"Hacer check-in\" "
"width=\"80px\" height=\"80px\" href=\"%24%7Bobject.get_portal_url()%7D\"></"
"center></a>\n"
"                                        </td>\n"
"                                    </tr>\n"
"                                </table>\n"
